sd-3-clause","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTU="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["alignment","data-analysis","data-science","flexible","pandas","python"],"visibility":"public","forks":19393,"open_issues":3594,"watchers":47298,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Hi,\n\nI have noticed that importing/exporting data from/to Stata seems to increase file size a lot (sometimes more than double). I thought it mostly was caused by export to Stata, where string variables would be initially set to a length of 256 or something like that (usually after exporting I have to run the compress command in Stata and save the file again in order to save space). But now I noticed that importing data in Stata format and then exporting it to CSV causes similar increases in file size, even after dropping variables from the original file (so one would expect the file to be smaller). Any ideas of what is going on? \n\nAn example of a stata file with the exported csv file and script can be found [here](https://www.dropbox.com/s/xdimn6k40t7fmf4/Export_filesize_issue.zip?dl=0).\n\nI ran the following commands in a script (included in the zip file):\n\n```\n#!/usr/bin/env python\n# coding: utf-8\nfrom __future__ import division\nimport sys, os, time\n# Math, data\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Print filesize original\nprint('Original filesize= '+str(os.path.getsize('./cn59_mat.dta'))) #Original filesize= 2883761\n# Load data\ndf=pd.read_stata('cn59_mat.dta')\n# Drop one variable\ndf.drop('index', axis=1, inplace=True)\n# Export\ndf.to_csv('cn59.csv', encoding='utf-8', index=False)\n# Print filesize original\nprint('New filesize= '+str(os.path.getsize('./cn59.csv'))) #New filesize= 4984671\n```\n\nSo as you can see it doubled in size. I am using Python 2.7.6 with Pandas 0.15.1 on OS X 10.9.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/9062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/9062/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]